        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "13",
          "id": "67-13",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "In relation to the amount referred to in sub-section (12)(b) and (c),—",
          "clauses": [
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "a",
              "id": "67-13-a",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 395.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "the cost of acquisition and the cost of improvement shall be taken as nil; and",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "b",
              "id": "67-13-b",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 415.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "in a case, where the enhanced compensation or consideration is received by any other person due to the death of the person who made the transfer, or for any other reason, such amount shall be deemed as the income chargeable to tax under the head \"Capital gains\" in the hands of such other person.",
              "children": []
            }
          ],
          "text_after_clauses": "",
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-67-13-001",
              "target_id": "67-12-b",
              "target_type": "clause",
              "anchor_text": "sub-section (12)(b) and (c)",
              "relationship": "related_to",
              "confidence": "high"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "14",
          "id": "67-14",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "Irrespective of anything contained in sub-section (1), if the capital gains arises to a person (being an individual or a Hindu undivided family), from the transfer of a capital asset, being land or building or both, under a specified agreement, then,—",
          "clauses": [
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "a",
              "id": "67-14-a",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 395.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "such capital gains shall be chargeable to income-tax for the tax year in which the certificate of completion for the whole or part of the project is issued by the competent authority; and",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "b",
              "id": "67-14-b",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 415.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "for the purposes of section 72, the stamp duty value, on the date of issue of the said certificate, of the share of such person, being land or building or both, in the project, as increased by any consideration received in cash or by a cheque or draft or by any other mode shall be deemed to be the full value of the consideration received or accruing as a result of the transfer of such capital asset.",
              "children": [],
              "references": [
                {
                  "reference_id": "ref-67-14-b-001",
                  "target_id": "72",
                  "target_type": "section",
                  "anchor_text": "section 72",
                  "relationship": "definition_or_scope",
                  "confidence": "medium"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "text_after_clauses": "",
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-67-14-001",
              "target_id": "67-1",
              "target_type": "subsection",
              "anchor_text": "sub-section (1)",
              "relationship": "related_to",
              "confidence": "high"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "15",
          "id": "67-15",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "In sub-section (14),—",
          "clauses": [
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "a",
              "id": "67-15-a",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 395.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "\"competent authority\" means the authority empowered to approve the building plan under any law;",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "b",
              "id": "67-15-b",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 415.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "\"specified agreement\" means a registered agreement in which a person owning land or building, or both, agrees to allow another person to develop a real estate project on such land or building, or both, in consideration of a share, being land or building or both, in such project, whether with or without payment of part of the consideration in cash.",
              "children": []
            }
          ],
          "text_after_clauses": "",
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-67-15-001",
              "target_id": "67-14",
              "target_type": "subsection",
              "anchor_text": "sub-section (14)",
              "relationship": "related_to",
              "confidence": "high"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "16",
          "id": "67-16",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "The provisions of sub-section (14) shall not apply, if the person transfers his share in the project on or before the date of issue of the certificate of completion, and then,—",
          "clauses": [
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "a",
              "id": "67-16-a",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 395.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "the capital gains shall be deemed to be the income of the tax year of such transfer; and",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "b",
              "id": "67-16-b",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 415.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "the provisions of this Act, other than sub-section (14), shall apply for the purpose of determination of full value of consideration.",
              "children": [],
              "references": [
                {
                  "reference_id": "ref-67-16-b-001",
                  "target_id": "67-14",
                  "target_type": "subsection",
                  "anchor_text": "sub-section (14)",
                  "relationship": "related_to",
                  "confidence": "high"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "text_after_clauses": "",
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-67-16-001",
              "target_id": "67-14",
              "target_type": "subsection",
              "anchor_text": "sub-section (14)",
              "relationship": "exception_to",
              "confidence": "high"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "17",
          "id": "67-17",
          "x": 27.62,
          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "Irrespective of anything contained in sub-section (1), the difference between the repurchase price of the units referred to in section 80CCB(2) of the Income-tax Act, 1961 (43 of 1961) and the capital value of such units shall be deemed to be the capital gains arising to the assessee in the tax year in which—",
          "clauses": [
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "a",
              "id": "67-17-a",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 395.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "such repurchase takes place; or",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "clause",
              "number": "b",
              "id": "67-17-b",
              "x": 40.8,
              "y_start": 415.0,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "the plan referred to in that section is terminated.",
              "children": []
            }
          ],
          "text_after_clauses": "",
